1
00:00:23,605 --> 00:00:33,287
My hand is on your arm as you pull me along 
through the velvet of the dark, rolling hills,

2
00:00:34,382 --> 00:00:45,766
And I whisper to stop, so you squeeze on the brakes 
till the engine goes quiet and everything chills.

3
00:00:46,289 --> 00:00:57,006
The crickets fall silent, the wind has gone down, 
and the universe pauses its spinning tonight,

4
00:00:57,328 --> 00:01:08,356
No moon in the sky, just a million bright stars
that are bathing my Paul and my world in their light.

5
00:01:11,482 --> 00:01:21,897
And I don’t need the words, and I don’t need a song,
just the beat of your heart under my head,

6
00:01:22,218 --> 00:01:32,221
With your breath in my hair and my cheek on your chest, 
where all of our fears are unsaid.

7
00:01:36,698 --> 00:01:46,692
The stars are our witnesses, quiet and deep,
in a world that is letting us breathe,

8
00:01:47,559 --> 00:01:57,781
With my hand on your back in the blue-black of night,
there is nothing we need to retrieve.

9
00:02:24,598 --> 00:02:35,606
I walk straight to where you are standing so still, 
and I open your coat as the cold breezes blow,

10
00:02:35,736 --> 00:02:46,640
To slide my cold fingers deep under the cloth, 
to the warmth of your skin that I’m longing to know.

11
00:02:47,021 --> 00:02:57,765
I pull myself close with my head on your chest,
breathing in all the scent of your leather and wind,

12
00:02:57,846 --> 00:03:09,283
And I cling to your back under starlight and dew, 
with our shadows so safely and closely entwined.

13
00:03:12,371 --> 00:03:22,789
I feel your warm lips as they press on my head 
in a tender and lingering, beautiful kiss,

14
00:03:23,151 --> 00:03:34,460
Then I tilt up my head and I look in your eyes,
just to drown in this moment of absolute bliss.

15
00:03:37,209 --> 00:03:48,306
“We are here,” I just whisper so soft in your ear 
with a smile that is burning so tender and bright,

16
00:03:48,448 --> 00:04:00,216
And you nod in the silence and hold me so tight 
as the clocks lose their chime in the magical night.

